<main class="legal-page wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Legal information</p><h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
  <p><strong>Last updated: 11 October 2026</strong></p>
  <p>This notice explains what information Nexvora Trading &amp; Solution collects through this website, how that information is used, and the choices you have about it.</p>
  <h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you submit an enquiry, the form may collect your name, email address, phone number, country, trading experience, preferred market, learning goals and message. The site records your consent and submission time.</p>
  <h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used to respond to your enquiry, provide requested program or community updates, maintain operational records, and protect the website from abuse. Do not submit passwords, bank details or other sensitive financial information.</p>
  <h2>Storage and service providers</h2><p>Enquiries are stored using hosting and database services with access controls appropriate to the service. Service providers are used only as needed to operate the website and respond to enquiries, and they process information on our behalf.</p>
  <h2>Sharing and retention</h2><p>We do not sell your personal information. Information may be shared only where needed to operate the website, respond to your enquiry, or meet a legal obligation. Enquiries are retained for as long as needed to respond to them and maintain operational records.</p>
  <h2>Contact and privacy requests</h2><p>You may ask us to access, correct or delete the information you have submitted.<% if (site.email) { %> Send privacy requests to <a class="inline-link" href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a>.<% } else { %> Send privacy requests through the enquiry form on this website.<% } %> We will respond to requests in line with applicable law.</p>
  <h2>Security and changes</h2><p>We use reasonable safeguards to protect information, but no internet transmission or storage system can be guaranteed completely secure. This notice may be updated as the service changes; the current version will always be published on this page.</p>
  <p><a class="btn secondary" href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
</main><%- include("../partials/footer") %></body></html>
